{"text":"<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ljnEq7tdUSg</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### 8. Aṭṭhakapuggalapaññatti </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2320.652079\">38:40</span> 207. Tattha katame cattāro maggasamaṅgino, cattāro phalasamaṅgino puggalā? Sotāpanno, sotāpattiphalasacchikiriyāya paṭipanno; sakadāgāmī, sakadāgāmiphalasacchikiriyāya paṭipanno; anāgāmī, anāgāmiphalasacchikiriyāya paṭipanno; arahā, arahattaphalasacchikiriyāya [arahattāya (syā. ka.) a. ni. 8.59] paṭipanno; ime cattāro maggasamaṅgino, ime cattāro phalasamaṅgino puggalā. ^4-8-207</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2365.6276\">39:25</span> Aṭṭhakaniddeso.</p>","media-time":2376.413238}